tion":"The climax shows two Chargers towing a huge vault through the city."},{"id":"q6","question":"Which character is revealed to be alive in Fast & Furious 6 after being believed dead?","options":[{"id":"a","text":"Letty","is_correct":true},{"id":"b","text":"Han","is_correct":false},{"id":"c","text":"Jesse","is_correct":false},{"id":"d","text":"Vince","is_correct":false}],"explanation":"Letty reappears working with Shaw''s crew, suffering from amnesia."},{"id":"q7","question":"What is the name of Dom''s sister?","options":[{"id":"a","text":"Elena","is_correct":false},{"id":"b","text":"Ramsey","is_correct":false},{"id":"c","text":"Mia","is_correct":true},{"id":"d","text":"Gisele","is_correct":false}],"explanation":"Mia Toretto later becomes Brian''s partner."},{"id":"q8","question":"In Furious 7, why does Deckard Shaw hunt Dom''s crew?","options":[{"id":"a","text":"To steal a car collection","is_correct":false},{"id":"b","text":"To avenge his brother Owen","is_correct":true},{"id":"c","text":"To recover stolen gold","is_correct":false},{"id":"d","text":"Because Dom betrayed him","is_correct":false}],"explanation":"Deckard seeks revenge for Owen, left comatose at the end of the sixth film."}]'::jsonb,
